GIMP Palette
Name: Base 2D kit - Endesga 32
Columns: 8
# Endesga 32 by Endesga (lospec.com/palette-list/endesga-32), chosen 2026-10-18 for the kit's
#   placeholder art. Each game built on the kit swaps in its own palette.
# Slot 0 is SEE-THROUGH. Never paint with it (Aseprite Indexed index 0 erases - trap 62).
# Slots are grouped into ramps by name (ramp-N, dark to light). pxkit reads the ramps from these
#   names, so a renamed slot is a moved ramp. Load THIS file in Aseprite, not Aseprite's built-in
#   Endesga 32 preset: same colours, different slot order (trap 61).
# The floor of the test arena is steel-2; steel-0 is the void outside it and the outline colour.
# Ramps: steel(7), wood(5), skin(2), rust(2), fire(5), green(4), blue(3), plum(3), hot(1)
